{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40705","headline":"春日即事寄一二知己 · 李洞","name":"春日即事寄一二知己","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"浴马池西一带泉，开门景物似樊川。\n朱衣暎水人归县，白羽遗泥鹤上天。\n索米夜烧风折木，无车春养雪藏鞭。\n缙绅处士知章句，忍使孤窗枕泪眠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李洞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40705.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40705","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}